# Nix build outputs
result
result-*

# scaffold state (profiles, logs, caches)
.scaffold/

# generated by logos-module-builder at build time
generated_code/

# editor / OS
*.swp
.DS_Store
.scaffold

# AI tool directories. Generated or machine-local: `lgs init`'s output,
# `openspec init`'s skills and commands, settings.local.json, worktrees.
#
# `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/` because git will not re-include a file
# whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded — with a `.claude/` rule the negations
# below are never consulted.
#
# A directory negation is RECURSIVE: `!.claude/<dir>/` stops `.claude/*`
# applying to anything beneath it, so a nested scratch directory or a stray
# `settings.local.json` dropped in there becomes trackable. The failure is a
# generated file committed silently, which nobody notices. So re-admit files
# by name where you can, and a directory only when everything in it is meant
# to be tracked. The role agents are the specflow plugin's; a project agent
# added later is re-admitted as its one file.
#
# `settings.json` is not a preference file: it carries
# `worktree.baseRef = "head"`, which is what makes `isolation: "worktree"`
# fork an agent from the runner's HEAD instead of `origin/main`, and it enables
# the specflow plugin. Ignored, it reached no clone and no fresh checkout, and
# **nothing failed when it was absent** — agents were silently cut from the
# wrong base, which is the failure this repo keeps re-learning. Machine-local
# settings belong in `settings.local.json`, which stays ignored.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
.cursor/
AGENTS.md

# agent scratch space
tmp/

# test run output
radicle-ui/tests/out.txt
radicle-ui/tests/results.txt

# release staging (ci.yml) — ui-tests.yml no longer stages here, it reads
# .scaffold/basecamp/lgx/ directly
dist/

# UI test run outputs (ui-tests.yml)
basecamp/
ui-results/

# local scratch: the inspector-enabled Basecamp copy, staged .lgx files,
# throwaway user-dirs and build logs from running the end-to-end layer by hand
tmp/

# specflow
!.claude/specflow/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/hooks/
